\fs30 \

\b0\fs28\fi-1960\li2380 DESCRIPTION	
\b SNDBootDSP()
\b0  boots the DSP using the DSP bootstrap image specified in 
\i dspCore.
\i0   This allows you to load all internal RAM and all but the top six words of external RAM on the DSP.  The owner and device ports must have been previously acquired through 
\b SNDAcquire()
\b0 .  The format of 
\i dspCore
\i0  must SND_FORMAT_DSP core image should be in loadable (ª.lodº) form, such as is created through the 
\b SNDReadDSPfile()
\b0  function.\

\fs20 \

\fs10 \

\fs28\fi-1320 RETURN	If no error occurs, SND_ERR_NONE is returned.  Otherwise, an error code, as described in 
\b SNDSoundError()
